{\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":11,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"His death in 212 or 211 BC during the Roman siege of Syracuse has become the stuff of legend.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFPRmbaPW4rCsXtTL69d4QoO8GeVieKrDUH5Yw2BUgeMxpwAHbD1YZXdG1hMhhhHZ0qsUJxTNAfYIQslriV9DYL_STjwruTXn7OI7P1jbBBj5VgtjWiL-fVUDt1h8mmGx6yxQswe8YRrCsH\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"c8226ebd-3dbb-41d4-aeb6-7baa0e80b198\",\"created\":1771936159,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":12,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"nyu.edu\",\"data\":\"His death in 212 or 211 BC during the Roman siege of Syracuse has become the stuff of legend.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHfbZhFGY8Zmra1nBT5GPS38i1xfU-RvE2DsJQGsGGnqsOaQHmuE5fgpghuI7tfbSpl8xjY3PW7IHtbtpJFJtNKaHAmNFYn9ZpTU7SIHqabH7WcIfhh04YuQpf8oYwD1ccjtQfEG8op9Q==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"c8226ebd-3dbb-41d4-aeb6-7baa0e80b198\",\"created\":1771936159,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":13,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"Despite orders from the Roman general Marcellus that the famed mathematician should not be harmed, a Roman soldier killed Archimedes.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFwpbizgeqexEU7__qwCVZmqo3khaMV32GRYghxV9tKRIceztvK1EjPPOQEIY__nzTsfJYUgn6ePjDp35ojqq5Y9djFWFruzEogAjKJeajpdtPWv2oadqXMG3f6kspUjZIg4Zs=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"c8226ebd-3dbb-41d4-aeb6-7baa0e80b198\",\"created\":1771936159,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":14,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"One popular account suggests that Archimedes was so absorbed in a mathematical diagram that he refused to leave his work when confronted by the soldier.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFPRmbaPW4rCsXtTL69d4QoO8GeVieKrDUH5Yw2BUgeMxpwAHbD1YZXdG1hMhhhHZ0qsUJxTNAfYIQslriV9DYL_STjwruTXn7OI7P1jbBBj5VgtjWiL-fVUDt1h8mmGx6yxQswe8YRrCsH\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"c8226ebd-3dbb-41d4-aeb6-7baa0e80b198\",\"created\":1771936159,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":15,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"So proud was Archimedes of his mathematical discoveries that he requested his tomb be marked with a sphere and a cylinder, representing his finding on their relative volumes and surface areas.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFwpbizgeqexEU7__qwCVZmqo3khaMV32GRYghxV9tKRIceztvK1EjPPOQEIY__nzTsfJYUgn6ePjDp35ojqq5Y9djFWFruzEogAjKJeajpdtPWv2oadqXMG3f6kspUjZIg4Zs=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"c8226ebd-3dbb-41d4-aeb6-7baa0e80b198\",\"created\":1771936159,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":16,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"So proud was Archimedes of his mathematical discoveries that he requested his tomb be marked with a sphere and a cylinder, representing his finding on their relative volumes and surface areas.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFPRmbaPW4rCsXtTL69d4QoO8GeVieKrDUH5Yw2BUgeMxpwAHbD1YZXdG1hMhhhHZ0qsUJxTNAfYIQslriV9DYL_STjwruTXn7OI7P1jbBBj5VgtjWiL-fVUDt1h8mmGx6yxQswe8YRrCsH\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"c8226ebd-3dbb-41d4-aeb6-7baa0e80b198\",\"created\":1771936159,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":17,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"mathnasium.com\",\"data\":\"He is often referred to as the \\\"father of mathematics\\\" and the \\\"father of mathematical physics\\\" for his foundational work.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHrrcQZ-p3Pbo1uhZt0Dr6NQ6a7DCGsANMl2AnCPNJwegqXYumu29O4HpnTUlBq39Efvf-hcJCGOfIs2H_9ScaNSm09uNeEFLYwI9KQ9Rg_QJtJyKUXpkVvivJh7aG_C88-ikZDWfSVLUPC1nprpVk_7K7kM4Fi0D3xxkVNneZmRik3pRjgItHwW5Y9v5DV\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"c8226ebd-3dbb-41d4-aeb6-7baa0e80b198\",\"created\":1771936159,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":18,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"nyu.edu\",\"data\":\"He is often referred to as the \\\"father of mathematics\\\" and the \\\"father of mathematical physics\\\" for his foundational work.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHfbZhFGY8Zmra1nBT5GPS38i1xfU-RvE2DsJQGsGGnqsOaQHmuE5fgpghuI7tfbSpl8xjY3PW7IHtbtpJFJtNKaHAmNFYn9ZpTU7SIHqabH7WcIfhh04YuQpf8oYwD1ccjtQfEG8op9Q==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"c8226ebd-3dbb-41d4-aeb6-7baa0e80b198\",\"created\":1771936159,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":19,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"st-andrews.ac.uk\",\"data\":\"*   **Calculating an accurate approximation of Pi (\\u03c0):** By inscribing and circumscribing a circle with polygons of 96 sides, he determined that the value of pi lay between 3 10/71 and 3 1/7.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFYbm7vOmv-EPAgHRvd2G0PTHZ-pRPxnijG6ycpWzptP7HM_sAYYVgT0ASf9bhOp8f1YU9Ohb0D5-BQXm9MvD2STsEHi_HZXQ5za1fIYxbTbS5-ZsZ-geDxk1zd2mq-3MvCdRTfTZfombhbO8A2wFSC_E1eG3qYT_s=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"c8226ebd-3dbb-41d4-aeb6-7baa0e80b198\",\"created\":1771936159,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":20,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"*   **Anticipating modern calculus:** Through the \\\"method of exhaustion,\\\" an early form of integration, he was able to calculate the areas and volumes of various geometric figures, including the area of a circle and the surface area and volume of a sphere.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFwpbizgeqexEU7__qwCVZmqo3khaMV32GRYghxV9tKRIceztvK1EjPPOQEIY__nzTsfJYUgn6ePjDp35ojqq5Y9djFWFruzEogAjKJeajpdtPWv2oadqXMG3f6kspUjZIg4Zs=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"c8226ebd-3dbb-41d4-aeb6-7baa0e80b198\",\"created\":1771936159,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":21,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"st-andrews.ac.uk\",\"data\":\"*   **Anticipating modern calculus:** Through the \\\"method of exhaustion,\\\" an early form of integration, he was able to calculate the areas and volumes of various geometric figures, including the area of a circle and the surface area and volume of a sphere.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFYbm7vOmv-EPAgHRvd2G0PTHZ-pRPxnijG6ycpWzptP7HM_sAYYVgT0ASf9bhOp8f1YU9Ohb0D5-BQXm9MvD2STsEHi_HZXQ5za1fIYxbTbS5-ZsZ-geDxk1zd2mq-3MvCdRTfTZfombhbO8A2wFSC_E1eG3qYT_s=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"c8226ebd-3dbb-41d4-aeb6-7baa0e80b198\",\"created\":1771936159,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":22,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"mathnasium.com\",\"data\":\"*   **Anticipating modern calculus:** Through the \\\"method of exhaustion,\\\" an early form of integration, he was able to calculate the areas and volumes of various geometric figures, including the area of a circle and the surface area and volume of a sphere.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHrrcQZ-p3Pbo1uhZt0Dr6NQ6a7DCGsANMl2AnCPNJwegqXYumu29O4HpnTUlBq39Efvf-hcJCGOfIs2H_9ScaNSm09uNeEFLYwI9KQ9Rg_QJtJyKUXpkVvivJh7aG_C88-ikZDWfSVLUPC1nprpVk_7K7kM4Fi0D3xxkVNneZmRik3pRjgItHwW5Y9v5DV\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"c8226ebd-3dbb-41d4-aeb6-7baa0e80b198\",\"created\":1771936159,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":23,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"*   **Developing a system for expressing large numbers:** In his work \\\"The Sand Reckoner,\\\" he devised a system to calculate and express an immense number, far greater than the number of grains of sand required to fill the universe.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFwpbizgeqexEU7__qwCVZmqo3khaMV32GRYghxV9tKRIceztvK1EjPPOQEIY__nzTsfJYUgn6ePjDp35ojqq5Y9djFWFruzEogAjKJeajpdtPWv2oadqXMG3f6kspUjZIg4Zs=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"c8226ebd-3dbb-41d4-aeb6-7baa0e80b198\",\"created\":1771936159,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":24,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"st-andrews.ac.uk\",\"data\":\"*   **Hydrostatics and the principle of buoyancy:** Famously known as \\\"Archimedes' principle,\\\" he discovered that a body immersed in a fluid experiences an upward buoyant force equal to the weight of the fluid it displaces.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFYbm7vOmv-EPAgHRvd2G0PTHZ-pRPxnijG6ycpWzptP7HM_sAYYVgT0ASf9bhOp8f1YU9Ohb0D5-BQXm9MvD2STsEHi_HZXQ5za1fIYxbTbS5-ZsZ-geDxk1zd2mq-3MvCdRTfTZfombhbO8A2wFSC_E1eG3qYT_s=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"c8226ebd-3dbb-41d4-aeb6-7baa0e80b198\",\"created\":1771936159,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":25,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"*   **Hydrostatics and the principle of buoyancy:** Famously known as \\\"Archimedes' principle,\\\" he discovered that a body immersed in a fluid experiences an upward buoyant force equal to the weight of the fluid it displaces.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFPRmbaPW4rCsXtTL69d4QoO8GeVieKrDUH5Yw2BUgeMxpwAHbD1YZXdG1hMhhhHZ0qsUJxTNAfYIQslriV9DYL_STjwruTXn7OI7P1jbBBj5VgtjWiL-fVUDt1h8mmGx6yxQswe8YRrCsH\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"c8226ebd-3dbb-41d4-aeb6-7baa0e80b198\",\"created\":1771936159,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":26,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"mathnasium.com\",\"data\":\"*   **Hydrostatics and the principle of buoyancy:** Famously known as \\\"Archimedes' principle,\\\" he discovered that a body immersed in a fluid experiences an upward buoyant force equal to the weight of the fluid it displaces.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHrrcQZ-p3Pbo1uhZt0Dr6NQ6a7DCGsANMl2AnCPNJwegqXYumu29O4HpnTUlBq39Efvf-hcJCGOfIs2H_9ScaNSm09uNeEFLYwI9KQ9Rg_QJtJyKUXpkVvivJh7aG_C88-ikZDWfSVLUPC1nprpVk_7K7kM4Fi0D3xxkVNneZmRik3pRjgItHwW5Y9v5DV\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"c8226ebd-3dbb-41d4-aeb6-7baa0e80b198\",\"created\":1771936159,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":27,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"mathnasium.com\",\"data\":\"This principle explains why ships float.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHrrcQZ-p3Pbo1uhZt0Dr6NQ6a7DCGsANMl2AnCPNJwegqXYumu29O4HpnTUlBq39Efvf-hcJCGOfIs2H_9ScaNSm09uNeEFLYwI9KQ9Rg_QJtJyKUXpkVvivJh7aG_C88-ikZDWfSVLUPC1nprpVk_7K7kM4Fi0D3xxkVNneZmRik3pRjgItHwW5Y9v5DV\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"c8226ebd-3dbb-41d4-aeb6-7baa0e80b198\",\"created\":1771936159,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":28,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"*   **Statics and the law of the lever:** He is credited with proving the law of the lever and understanding the concept of the center of gravity.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFwpbizgeqexEU7__qwCVZmqo3khaMV32GRYghxV9tKRIceztvK1EjPPOQEIY__nzTsfJYUgn6ePjDp35ojqq5Y9djFWFruzEogAjKJeajpdtPWv2oadqXMG3f6kspUjZIg4Zs=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"c8226ebd-3dbb-41d4-aeb6-7baa0e80b198\",\"created\":1771936159,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":29,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"*   **The Archimedes Screw:** This device, consisting of a screw-shaped surface inside a tube, was designed to raise water and is still used today for irrigation and pumping sewage.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFPRmbaPW4rCsXtTL69d4QoO8GeVieKrDUH5Yw2BUgeMxpwAHbD1YZXdG1hMhhhHZ0qsUJxTNAfYIQslriV9DYL_STjwruTXn7OI7P1jbBBj5VgtjWiL-fVUDt1h8mmGx6yxQswe8YRrCsH\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"c8226ebd-3dbb-41d4-aeb6-7baa0e80b198\",\"created\":1771936159,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":30,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"mathnasium.com\",\"data\":\"*   **The Archimedes Screw:** This device, consisting of a screw-shaped surface inside a tube, was designed to raise water and is still used today for irrigation and pumping sewage.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHrrcQZ-p3Pbo1uhZt0Dr6NQ6a7DCGsANMl2AnCPNJwegqXYumu29O4HpnTUlBq39Efvf-hcJCGOfIs2H_9ScaNSm09uNeEFLYwI9KQ9Rg_QJtJyKUXpkVvivJh7aG_C88-ikZDWfSVLUPC1nprpVk_7K7kM4Fi0D3xxkVNneZmRik3pRjgItHwW5Y9v5DV\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"c8226ebd-3dbb-41d4-aeb6-7baa0e80b198\",\"created\":1771936159,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":31,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"*   **War Machines:** To defend Syracuse against the Romans, he is said to have designed a variety of war machines, including powerful catapults and compound pulleys.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFwpbizgeqexEU7__qwCVZmqo3khaMV32GRYghxV9tKRIceztvK1EjPPOQEIY__nzTsfJYUgn6ePjDp35ojqq5Y9djFWFruzEogAjKJeajpdtPWv2oadqXMG3f6kspUjZIg4Zs=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"c8226ebd-3dbb-41d4-aeb6-7baa0e80b198\",\"created\":1771936159,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":32,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"mit.edu\",\"data\":\"*   **War Machines:** To defend Syracuse against the Romans, he is said to have designed a variety of war machines, including powerful catapults and compound pulleys.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHh0qRm8AJBNePpetcFgPA8JbtvyrAtS--gnq5tygWVucceZMY0xw0cUqPFy24zL3CtH4bJZHgXbTcseMKI7pRDJOhfM70L3OZp7o4Yfqi8qJS4ZR8ygtm1Rz61Kw5gkbWbKtqQBC9zoqNUzsP503RtyAnj\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"c8226ebd-3dbb-41d4-aeb6-7baa0e80b198\",\"created\":1771936159,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":33,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"mit.edu\",\"data\":\"The legend of him using \\\"burning mirrors\\\" to set enemy ships ablaze, while debated, speaks to his reputation as a formidable inventor.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHh0qRm8AJBNePpetcFgPA8JbtvyrAtS--gnq5tygWVucceZMY0xw0cUqPFy24zL3CtH4bJZHgXbTcseMKI7pRDJOhfM70L3OZp7o4Yfqi8qJS4ZR8ygtm1Rz61Kw5gkbWbKtqQBC9zoqNUzsP503RtyAnj\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"c8226ebd-3dbb-41d4-aeb6-7baa0e80b198\",\"created\":1771936159,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":34,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"mathnasium.com\",\"data\":\"The legend of him using \\\"burning mirrors\\\" to set enemy ships ablaze, while debated, speaks to his reputation as a formidable inventor.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHrrcQZ-p3Pbo1uhZt0Dr6NQ6a7DCGsANMl2AnCPNJwegqXYumu29O4HpnTUlBq39Efvf-hcJCGOfIs2H_9ScaNSm09uNeEFLYwI9KQ9Rg_QJtJyKUXpkVvivJh7aG_C88-ikZDWfSVLUPC1nprpVk_7K7kM4Fi0D3xxkVNneZmRik3pRjgItHwW5Y9v5DV\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"c8226ebd-3dbb-41d4-aeb6-7baa0e80b198\",\"created\":1771936159,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":35,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"Archimedes' work was far ahead of its time, and his writings, which he shared through correspondence with other mathematicians, provided a foundation for centuries of scientific inquiry.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFwpbizgeqexEU7__qwCVZmqo3khaMV32GRYghxV9tKRIceztvK1EjPPOQEIY__nzTsfJYUgn6ePjDp35ojqq5Y9djFWFruzEogAjKJeajpdtPWv2oadqXMG3f6kspUjZIg4Zs=\",\"reference_type\